  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mamdi Polder Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a part of the Chad Government is overall plan to reclaim 100,000 ha of polder land from the Chad lake. The project will isolate and dry up a part of lake to reclaim 1,630 ha for irrigated agriculture. The lake Chad Polders have been evaluated as one

of the best agricultural lands in the world.</narrative>
  </description>
